cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Made to Measure: Designing Image Watermarks to Specification"
message: "If you use this software, please cite the paper."
type: software
abstract: >-
  TAILOR takes a deployment request, as an attack set, a false-positive budget, a PSNR
  floor and a latency ceiling, and returns a watermark configuration that meets all four,
  or reports that the library cannot. Configuration selection is an SMT problem over a
  measured database of attack coverage, distortion and runtime.
authors:
  - name: "Anonymous"
license: MIT
